        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-07T21:10:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I figure that the cards only remain targets while Imbued Vitality is in play - it's a distortion in reality which is causing everyone's stuff to come to life. The moment that distortion ends, it all turns back into inanimate objects again. There's nothing which says that the effects of the card remain active after the card is destroyed, either.</p>",
